WEBVTT

00:17.934 --> 00:18.852
"HERO" IS THE GRAVEST PUNISHMENT.

00:18.935 --> 00:19.853
HEROES ARE FORCED TO STAND
ON THE FRONTLINES,

00:19.936 --> 00:21.020
FIGHTING A NEVER-ENDING BATTLE
AGAINST THE DEMON BLIGHT,

00:21.104 --> 00:21.938
WHERE THEY'RE NOT ALLOWED TO DIE.

00:22.021 --> 00:22.856
THIS PUNISHMENT HAS NO END.

00:38.580 --> 00:40.081
This is bad.

00:40.165 --> 00:41.499
This is really bad!

00:56.264 --> 00:57.098
Hey!

01:01.186 --> 01:02.937
Damn these fuath...

01:03.021 --> 01:04.022
Lord Zelkoff...

01:09.027 --> 01:12.655
Why are you there?

01:23.833 --> 01:25.460
If we don't catch up quickly,
the coffin will be...

01:25.543 --> 01:26.503
No.

01:26.586 --> 01:27.754
Let's jump out from here.

01:27.837 --> 01:28.671
Wait for my signal.

01:28.755 --> 01:30.381
Wait, what about our "protection target"?

01:30.465 --> 01:32.008
We can't just run away like this...

01:34.761 --> 01:36.930
Damn it, this might really be the end!

01:43.645 --> 01:46.523
No way... Don't tell me the Temple wants...

01:48.608 --> 01:50.068
No! Stop it!

01:50.151 --> 01:52.070
No!

02:15.260 --> 02:17.637
Xylo! Hurry up!

02:17.720 --> 02:19.889
Do something about this guy!

02:57.093 --> 02:58.803
Don't move!
I can't stop the bleeding like this!

02:59.429 --> 03:01.014
That's enough. Just kill me.

03:01.097 --> 03:02.932
They can resurrect me later, anyway.

03:03.016 --> 03:04.225
Shut up!

03:04.309 --> 03:06.144
There's no way I'm carrying your corpse.

03:06.227 --> 03:07.729
Leave me alone!

03:07.812 --> 03:09.814
It doesn't matter
if it's someone else's corpse.

03:09.898 --> 03:12.025
As long as there's a corpse, we can...

03:13.526 --> 03:15.862
Enough! Listen up!

03:15.945 --> 03:18.197
The resurrection of us heroes

03:18.281 --> 03:20.533
is just a procedure that drags
the souls of the dead out of hell

03:20.617 --> 03:23.244
and stuffs them back into bodies.

03:23.828 --> 03:27.123
It leaves troublesome aftereffects
on one's memories and sense of self.

03:27.206 --> 03:29.834
Did you forget
because you died so many times?

03:29.918 --> 03:30.835
Tell me!

03:35.632 --> 03:36.841
Besides,

03:36.925 --> 03:40.595
the Holy Knights don't seem to have
any intention of collecting your body.

03:44.891 --> 03:47.018
If you really want to die,

03:48.978 --> 03:51.189
go die somewhere out of my sight.

03:55.485 --> 03:58.196
It's about time you made up your mind.

04:02.909 --> 04:05.286
If you understand,
then grit your teeth and bear with it.

04:23.513 --> 04:25.640
Sheesh, don't pull this kind of stunt.

04:25.723 --> 04:26.724
What an idiot.

04:29.394 --> 04:32.689
Dotta.
You need to fix your habit of stealing.

04:33.398 --> 04:34.899
- Because...
- What?

04:34.983 --> 04:38.152
I happened to see
a Holy Knight transport team.

04:38.820 --> 04:41.990
Besides, it's their fault for stopping
the carriages without any precautions.

04:42.073 --> 04:44.951
No matter how I look at it,
it's the thief's fault.

04:45.034 --> 04:48.454
I only told you to scout
the faeries' whereabouts.

04:55.753 --> 04:56.713
Xylo.

04:58.756 --> 05:01.134
There are really a lot of faeries.

05:02.135 --> 05:03.386
Yeah.

05:03.469 --> 05:06.306
For a Demon Blight, this scale is huge.

05:06.389 --> 05:10.101
According to HQ's pre-mission intel,
I remember it's 5,000.

05:10.184 --> 05:11.519
5... 5,000?!

05:11.602 --> 05:14.897
Are we two supposed to hold off
an army that big?

05:14.981 --> 05:15.815
Yes.

05:16.524 --> 05:20.903
This forest will soon be corrupted
by the Demon Blight.

05:21.487 --> 05:24.782
We have to support
those Holy Knight idiots in their retreat.

05:24.866 --> 05:27.201
Of course, there won't be
any reinforcements either.

05:29.912 --> 05:31.789
If you're thinking of escaping,
you'd better forget it.

05:32.373 --> 05:34.792
Unless you want to lose your head.

05:36.794 --> 05:39.213
But I guess it doesn't matter.

05:39.297 --> 05:42.884
After all, we heroes
can be resurrected even if we die.

05:42.967 --> 05:45.636
Whether it's our own or someone else's,

05:46.179 --> 05:47.388
as long as there's a corpse...

05:47.472 --> 05:49.057
Didn't I just tell you?

05:49.932 --> 05:53.019
Each resurrection erodes
your memories and sense of self.

05:53.644 --> 05:56.689
One day, you won't even
remember who you are.

05:59.734 --> 06:00.777
I don't want...

06:02.070 --> 06:03.988
that to happen.

06:07.408 --> 06:09.535
Heroes have no choice.

06:13.456 --> 06:15.291
Other than completing the mission,

06:16.709 --> 06:18.377
we can do nothing else.

06:20.046 --> 06:21.589
It's about time you gave up.

06:23.257 --> 06:24.842
- We need to move.
- Huh?

06:24.926 --> 06:27.970
While we're chatting,
the Holy Knights are taking casualties...

06:37.647 --> 06:38.564
What's this?

06:47.448 --> 06:49.158
Hey, this is...

06:50.326 --> 06:51.577
Dotta!

06:51.661 --> 06:54.664
You've got to be kidding me.
Why did you have to go and steal a coffin?

06:55.748 --> 06:56.666
Well...

06:56.749 --> 07:00.169
I just felt like I could steal it.

07:00.253 --> 07:02.421
Before I knew it...

07:02.505 --> 07:05.633
L-Look, maybe there's something inside
that could be useful...

07:05.716 --> 07:06.634
You idiot!

07:06.717 --> 07:09.720
It's because you stole something like this
that the faeries are chasing you!

07:11.097 --> 07:12.098
Don't tell me...

07:12.765 --> 07:15.435
Hey, is there something inside?

07:16.269 --> 07:17.687
- Probably.
- What?

07:17.770 --> 07:21.107
It was really heavy and hard to move.

07:21.190 --> 07:23.776
Why did you steal a corpse?

07:23.860 --> 07:28.030
- I don't get you. Besides--
- I don't get it either.

07:28.114 --> 07:30.158
Before I knew it, I'd stolen it.

07:30.241 --> 07:33.119
Besides, it was in a place like that...

07:34.662 --> 07:35.746
Cut the crap.

07:36.414 --> 07:38.583
Watch it, or I'll kill you
before the faeries get here.

07:40.334 --> 07:41.461
Come on, don't be like this.

07:41.544 --> 07:42.920
If it's in the way,
we can just leave it here.

07:43.004 --> 07:45.006
If we get yelled at,
we can always return it, right?

07:55.516 --> 07:58.060
The corpse inside
must be a royal, a noble,

07:58.144 --> 08:01.147
or some bigshot from the Holy Knights.

08:01.731 --> 08:03.149
Maybe...

08:03.232 --> 08:05.985
it's one of the people I want to punch.

08:08.279 --> 08:11.199
Whoa...
She seems like a girl of some importance.

08:12.158 --> 08:13.326
Dotta.

08:13.409 --> 08:14.827
This is bad.

08:14.911 --> 08:15.745
Yeah.

08:16.329 --> 08:17.872
She must be a royal child, right?

08:17.955 --> 08:19.081
No.

08:20.416 --> 08:23.211
She's not even human.

08:23.294 --> 08:26.088
This kid is a goddess.

08:26.172 --> 08:27.632
What?

08:27.715 --> 08:29.342
What do you mean, "what"?

08:29.425 --> 08:31.052
She's a goddess, damn it!

08:31.135 --> 08:32.762
You said "Goddess"?

08:32.845 --> 08:36.974
I remember they were weapons created
long ago to fight Demon Lords, right?

08:37.058 --> 08:37.892
Yes.

08:37.975 --> 08:41.979
They're the so-called
"humanity's only hope."

08:42.522 --> 08:43.856
But...

08:43.940 --> 08:45.525
would they look like this girl?

08:45.608 --> 08:48.903
The ones I know look like giant whales

08:48.986 --> 08:51.155
or like lumps of iron...

08:51.822 --> 08:53.241
Let's go. If you dare bring that,

08:53.324 --> 08:54.367
- I'll kill you.
- Huh?

08:56.869 --> 08:57.870
Huh...

08:58.621 --> 08:59.747
A horn?

08:59.830 --> 09:00.831
Could it be the Holy Knights?

09:00.915 --> 09:02.917
Judging by the scale of the sound,

09:03.000 --> 09:05.753
it must be a recon unit
or a guerrilla unit...

09:05.836 --> 09:07.171
What's the situation?

09:07.255 --> 09:08.756
With your eyesight,
you should be able to see it, right?

09:10.550 --> 09:11.634
There's...

09:12.385 --> 09:13.636
a group of fuath...

09:14.178 --> 09:15.388
And...

09:16.597 --> 09:17.682
they're being attacked!

09:22.270 --> 09:23.479
Someone, help!

09:38.619 --> 09:40.246
Damn it, there are too many!

09:41.038 --> 09:43.332
We have to stop them here, no matter what!

09:52.133 --> 09:53.718
They're advancing faster than I thought.

09:54.677 --> 09:57.722
They should've been on guard
for a faerie ambush...

09:57.805 --> 09:59.181
Xylo, let's get out of here!

09:59.265 --> 10:01.517
Let's find a place to hide
until the battle is over.

10:03.060 --> 10:05.021
Not all of them are dead.

10:05.563 --> 10:06.647
Huh?

10:06.731 --> 10:09.442
Some are still hanging on for dear life.

10:09.525 --> 10:11.611
I think saving them is the best course.

10:11.694 --> 10:13.070
What are you talking about?

10:13.154 --> 10:14.780
That's not the best course at all!

10:14.864 --> 10:16.198
Our mission is

10:16.282 --> 10:19.118
to help more than half of the Holy Knights
evacuate the battlefield.

10:19.201 --> 10:22.455
Saving one more person
increases the mission's success rate.

10:22.538 --> 10:24.123
- What?
- We're going to fight.

10:24.665 --> 10:26.584
Before the sun completely sets,

10:26.667 --> 10:28.210
we're going to save those guys.

10:28.294 --> 10:30.963
- We'll jump straight down...
- Fight...

10:32.381 --> 10:34.842
Save...

10:37.928 --> 10:39.013
I see.

10:40.556 --> 10:42.099
What wonderful words.

10:42.808 --> 10:45.311
It appears you are my knight.

10:46.771 --> 10:47.980
Very well.

10:48.814 --> 10:50.775
I will give you a passing grade.

10:51.692 --> 10:56.614
That courage is perfectly suited
for a goddess like me.

11:00.618 --> 11:02.536
We are going to fight, right?

11:03.329 --> 11:06.582
And it is a battle to save others.

11:07.166 --> 11:08.042
Then,

11:08.626 --> 11:13.756
as a goddess, I shall grant your victory.

11:16.550 --> 11:20.179
Therefore, once the enemy
has been successfully exterminated,

11:20.262 --> 11:22.348
you are to praise me

11:23.474 --> 11:24.392
and...

11:25.059 --> 11:26.685
rub my head!

11:31.107 --> 11:33.359
Rub my head as much as you like.

11:33.442 --> 11:37.405
You may praise the grand power
of this goddess however you wish.

11:37.488 --> 11:41.283
Or, you may compose a song
that extols my virtues.

11:41.992 --> 11:45.746
That haughty pride
and intense desire for recognition...

11:45.830 --> 11:47.832
She's definitely the real deal.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.708
Huh? Is that so?

11:49.792 --> 11:50.668
Yes.

11:50.751 --> 11:52.670
She's a goddess,

11:52.753 --> 11:55.297
and probably the one
that hasn't even been activated yet,

11:55.381 --> 11:58.008
the thirteenth goddess.

11:58.092 --> 12:00.428
I am Goddess Teoritta,

12:00.511 --> 12:03.681
a guardian who brings miracles to people.

12:04.223 --> 12:05.933
Teoritta...

12:06.434 --> 12:07.560
My knight,

12:08.060 --> 12:10.312
rely on me to your heart's content.

12:10.896 --> 12:13.482
If that is what you seek,
I shall grant it.

12:13.566 --> 12:17.027
For that is the very meaning
of my existence.

12:19.155 --> 12:20.489
Easier said than done.

12:21.615 --> 12:23.492
- That's ridiculous.
- Huh?

12:24.076 --> 12:26.203
I hate goddesses.

12:29.039 --> 12:31.959
Dotta, you keep an eye on her.

12:32.042 --> 12:33.169
Huh? Ah...

12:33.752 --> 12:35.963
I don't want to rely on
the power of a goddess!

12:36.046 --> 12:37.298
Ah, wait...

12:46.765 --> 12:47.725
Dotta!

12:47.808 --> 12:49.393
Check the direction and distance.

12:49.477 --> 12:51.353
Where are they most concentrated?

12:51.437 --> 12:53.772
I... I really don't want to do this.

12:53.856 --> 12:55.191
We have to support the retreat!

12:55.274 --> 12:57.735
There's no point if we don't cause
a ruckus and draw attention.

12:58.611 --> 13:01.322
Ah... Jeez... I get it.

13:07.786 --> 13:08.829
Ten o'clock,

13:08.913 --> 13:11.290
one finger's width to nine o'clock!

13:11.373 --> 13:12.708
That way, huh?

13:12.791 --> 13:14.251
I see.

13:14.335 --> 13:17.338
That shabby-looking man
has good eyesight too.

13:17.421 --> 13:19.298
Hey, why are you here?

13:22.676 --> 13:25.179
What do you mean, why? You are my knight.

13:25.262 --> 13:27.056
I told you, I will grant you victory.

13:27.139 --> 13:28.432
Don't decide that on your own!

13:36.649 --> 13:38.108
They are coming, my knight.

13:38.192 --> 13:39.693
I don't need you!

13:43.822 --> 13:44.865
Anyway,

13:45.407 --> 13:46.492
stand back!

14:01.340 --> 14:02.174
What is that power?

14:02.258 --> 14:04.301
It's the sacred seal of heat and light.

14:04.385 --> 14:06.345
Go find a place nearby and hide.

14:11.433 --> 14:13.978
We'll distract them, so hurry up and...

14:23.279 --> 14:25.573
Ugh... I'm going to throw up.

14:25.656 --> 14:28.033
Dotta! Don't just stand there!

14:28.117 --> 14:29.326
You shoot too!

14:29.410 --> 14:30.744
Just keep shooting!

14:32.913 --> 14:34.999
I... I know!

14:37.877 --> 14:39.628
Wait...!

14:48.762 --> 14:50.639
I hit it! Aren't I awesome?

14:50.723 --> 14:52.266
Even with such an old lightning staff!

14:52.349 --> 14:55.394
There are so many of them.
It'd be impossible not to hit.

14:56.395 --> 14:57.646
Keep backing me up like this.

14:58.230 --> 14:59.481
Don't hit me, though!

15:03.444 --> 15:05.529
We cannot lose either!

15:05.613 --> 15:07.948
Uh, I...

15:08.032 --> 15:09.783
More importantly, if you're tired,

15:09.867 --> 15:11.493
- it's okay to take a break.
- Wait!

15:18.167 --> 15:19.543
Who else is still alive?

15:19.627 --> 15:20.711
I'll take care of them.

15:27.343 --> 15:28.552
Disappear!

15:49.573 --> 15:50.699
S-Sorry!

15:50.783 --> 15:52.242
I can't aim properly if it's too far...

15:52.326 --> 15:53.953
Just fire!

15:55.329 --> 15:56.622
Hurry up and finish them all!

15:56.705 --> 15:58.332
That way?

15:58.916 --> 16:00.960
W-Wait for me!

16:01.961 --> 16:03.754
My knight, wait!

16:04.838 --> 16:06.715
My knight!

16:21.730 --> 16:23.607
Hey, you're alive, right?

16:24.191 --> 16:25.109
Yes.

16:26.402 --> 16:27.653
We're saved.

16:27.736 --> 16:29.405
I didn't expect help to come...

16:29.488 --> 16:31.031
Get out of here now, and fast.

16:32.658 --> 16:33.826
What does that mean?

16:34.326 --> 16:36.829
Bastard, you're penal hero!

16:37.496 --> 16:38.497
A hero?

16:38.580 --> 16:40.207
Why is the condemned here?

16:40.290 --> 16:41.792
Why is he here?

16:42.793 --> 16:43.919
How could this be?

16:50.050 --> 16:53.095
Feels like the atmosphere isn't very good...

16:53.887 --> 16:56.807
This is an order. You just need to run.

16:56.890 --> 16:58.851
The next wave is coming soon.

16:58.934 --> 17:00.728
Stay out of our business!

17:02.563 --> 17:06.108
Being saved by you would damage our honor!

17:08.152 --> 17:09.611
Hey, Xylo.

17:09.695 --> 17:12.614
Normally,
we should be getting thanked, right?

17:13.532 --> 17:15.576
That's just how heroes are.

17:16.201 --> 17:17.077
Cut all that crap...

17:17.161 --> 17:19.371
I know, my knight.

17:19.455 --> 17:22.708
There is no way we would
just abandon them and run.

17:23.375 --> 17:24.835
Right? Isn't that right?

17:24.918 --> 17:26.003
Hold on!

17:27.838 --> 17:29.548
That golden hair.

17:29.631 --> 17:30.716
Those eyes.

17:31.216 --> 17:32.217
Could she be...

17:33.552 --> 17:35.929
Why do you have her with you?

17:36.013 --> 17:38.140
She should've been handed over
to the transport team!

17:46.106 --> 17:47.441
Answer me!

17:49.068 --> 17:51.862
If I answer, will you put down your sword?

18:01.038 --> 18:02.706
Okay, that's enough.

18:02.790 --> 18:05.167
This isn't the time to argue about this.

18:05.250 --> 18:07.503
The next wave is coming.
We have to figure something out.

18:08.545 --> 18:11.381
Xylo! Dotta! Can you hear me?

18:11.465 --> 18:13.842
Venetim, don't suddenly connect
to the communication seal!

18:13.926 --> 18:14.927
We're in trouble.

18:15.010 --> 18:16.887
Listen carefully! Everything's a mess.

18:16.970 --> 18:18.847
A real mess!

18:18.931 --> 18:22.059
Venetim always says, "We're in trouble."

18:22.142 --> 18:23.227
It's really bad.

18:23.310 --> 18:25.813
So bad that everything might fall apart.

18:25.896 --> 18:28.023
Xylo, are you free right now?

18:28.107 --> 18:29.316
No, I'm not.

18:34.029 --> 18:35.906
So? Did you hear that sound?

18:35.989 --> 18:37.950
Do you still think I'm free?

18:38.534 --> 18:40.994
I guess not...

18:41.078 --> 18:42.788
But if I don't tell you this,

18:42.871 --> 18:45.124
you'll definitely scold me later, Xylo.

18:45.207 --> 18:46.542
What is it?

18:47.626 --> 18:51.547
The Holy Knights' main force
is advancing toward the Demon Blight.

18:57.136 --> 18:59.680
Understood. Report to the Temple at once.

18:59.763 --> 19:00.639
Yes, sir!

19:01.723 --> 19:02.933
How should we report to the military?

19:03.016 --> 19:05.060
- What about the transport team?
- Venetim. What did you just say?

19:05.144 --> 19:05.936
Huh?

19:06.770 --> 19:07.729
- The goddess's safety
- I said, if I didn't tell you,

19:07.813 --> 19:09.815
- is our top priority.
- you'd scold me...

19:09.898 --> 19:11.441
- We have to stop it
- No, the part after that!

19:11.525 --> 19:12.943
- no matter what!
- Ah...

19:13.026 --> 19:15.195
- But...
- The Holy Knights regrouping

19:15.279 --> 19:16.738
- What should we do?
- in the forest over there

19:16.822 --> 19:19.700
have formed a battle line
against the Demon Blight,

19:19.783 --> 19:23.954
saying they're going to stop
the Demon Blight's advance here.

19:24.037 --> 19:26.206
What? What's going on?

19:26.290 --> 19:29.168
There's no way
I'd know something like that.

19:29.251 --> 19:32.754
Hey, what's your commander thinking?

19:32.838 --> 19:34.840
Didn't you receive the retreat order?

19:39.761 --> 19:41.138
Don't tell me...

19:42.556 --> 19:44.725
This was your plan all along?

19:50.314 --> 19:51.190
That's right.

19:51.273 --> 19:53.650
This is Commander Kivia's decision.

19:54.318 --> 19:55.569
Kivia?

19:55.652 --> 19:56.862
Is that guy an idiot?

19:56.945 --> 19:58.238
You bastard!

19:59.031 --> 20:01.325
We believe in her.

20:02.409 --> 20:05.746
If it's for her and the honor
of the Holy Knights,

20:05.829 --> 20:08.707
we won't hesitate to sacrifice our lives.

20:13.170 --> 20:14.671
Don't make me laugh.

20:16.089 --> 20:18.425
What can you do when you're half-dead?

20:18.508 --> 20:21.136
Well, about the topic earlier...

20:21.220 --> 20:23.347
What is it? Just spit it out!

20:23.430 --> 20:26.058
Is it really okay not to save them?

20:26.141 --> 20:28.101
If more than half
of the Holy Knights are killed,

20:28.185 --> 20:31.313
the hero unit's operation
will be considered a failure.

20:31.396 --> 20:33.065
If that happens, you won't just die.

20:33.148 --> 20:35.817
You'll also be burned
at the stake after resurrection.

20:35.901 --> 20:37.319
It's going to be painful.

20:37.402 --> 20:39.404
This is really bad.

20:39.488 --> 20:41.657
Uh... What should we do, Xylo?

20:41.740 --> 20:44.284
Why do you look so pathetic?

20:44.368 --> 20:47.955
Saving people from danger
is the greatest honor!

20:48.538 --> 20:49.915
Isn't that right, my knight?

20:49.998 --> 20:51.750
Shut up, both of you!

20:53.001 --> 20:53.919
Venetim.

20:54.002 --> 20:56.213
Where will the Holy Knights intercept it?

20:56.296 --> 20:59.132
Huh? Ah, well...

20:59.216 --> 21:00.884
Damn it, you're only checking now?

21:00.968 --> 21:03.345
No, of course not.

21:03.428 --> 21:07.808
Uh... they're in formation
at the second crossing point

21:07.891 --> 21:09.726
along the Purcell River.

21:09.810 --> 21:11.645
The second crossing point?

21:13.397 --> 21:15.857
If you're thinking of regrouping
with them, drop the idea.

21:15.941 --> 21:17.859
You'll just get in the way.

21:18.986 --> 21:23.448
We've already decided to live
and die with Commander Kivia.

21:23.532 --> 21:25.701
You're just a hero, so what do you know?

21:26.326 --> 21:28.745
Anyway, just head south and retreat.

21:29.538 --> 21:32.708
I've already driven back the faeries
that crushed your guerrilla unit.

21:32.791 --> 21:34.167
What?

21:34.251 --> 21:36.503
If you can reach
the south end of the forest,

21:36.586 --> 21:38.755
our supervising unit will be there.

21:38.839 --> 21:41.758
Do me a favor and beat up
the guy named Venetim.

21:43.802 --> 21:48.015
Next, I'm going to go complain
to your commander.

21:50.851 --> 21:54.187
Are you really going to cover our retreat?

21:54.980 --> 21:55.856
Dotta.

21:55.939 --> 21:57.649
Continue the operation as planned.

21:58.233 --> 22:00.193
Xylo, are you serious?

22:00.819 --> 22:02.321
Unfortunately, yes.

22:02.863 --> 22:06.616
Rendezvous with the Holy Knights
and prevent their defeat.

22:07.117 --> 22:08.535
What...

22:08.618 --> 22:11.204
That's my knight for you!
That's the spirit!

22:11.288 --> 22:13.248
I'm against it.

22:13.332 --> 22:17.419
Xylo, you don't want to die
for those Holy Knights, do you?

22:17.502 --> 22:18.795
Well, because you...

22:18.879 --> 22:20.047
Shut up!

22:21.882 --> 22:26.511
I also think those Holy Knights
should all just die.

22:26.595 --> 22:29.056
I hate those hell-bent
on throwing their lives away.

22:29.639 --> 22:31.266
But you know what?

22:31.349 --> 22:33.101
If we abandon them for reasons like that,

22:33.185 --> 22:35.645
they'll look down on us.

22:35.729 --> 22:37.397
I can't stand that.

22:38.690 --> 22:40.025
- Whoa!
- What the heck?

22:40.108 --> 22:41.568
Let's go.

22:42.444 --> 22:44.946
If the Holy Knights are annihilated,

22:45.030 --> 22:46.698
we're done for too.

23:05.634 --> 23:07.427
Now's our chance to resupply.

23:16.645 --> 23:17.604
Enemy sighted!

23:17.687 --> 23:19.606
Fall in, now!

23:24.319 --> 23:26.196
Lightning Staff Unit, advance!

23:39.835 --> 23:41.920
Prepare to intercept!

23:44.256 --> 23:46.216
Lure them as close as possible!

24:02.274 --> 24:04.067
Fire!

24:14.536 --> 24:16.079
First wave, annihilated!

24:16.163 --> 24:18.165
But there are too many of them!

24:19.166 --> 24:20.584
It's a troll!

24:26.131 --> 24:27.757
Use the large lightning staff!

24:28.675 --> 24:30.760
We can't let it cross the river!

24:35.515 --> 24:36.641
Fire!

24:53.867 --> 24:56.161
Oh, the fight's already started.

24:56.244 --> 24:59.164
Verkle Corp-crafted
Artillery Seal Compound?

24:59.247 --> 25:02.417
It's powerful, but they don't have
enough ammo for an army this big.

25:02.959 --> 25:05.670
Xylo, do you know any of the knights here?

25:07.214 --> 25:08.256
No, I don't.

25:09.090 --> 25:11.051
I've never seen that flag crest either.

25:11.134 --> 25:13.053
Then we don't need to get involved.

25:13.136 --> 25:15.013
I think they can handle it.

25:15.096 --> 25:17.015
What are you talking about?

25:18.016 --> 25:22.229
Don't you want to share
the glory of victory with them?

25:24.314 --> 25:27.734
There's no way anyone
would share that with us...

25:29.527 --> 25:30.362
Out of ammo!

25:31.321 --> 25:33.323
Commander, this cannon is done for!

25:34.115 --> 25:36.034
Engage them with standard weapons!

25:36.117 --> 25:38.495
Lancers will deal with the ones we miss.

25:55.387 --> 25:59.015
The faeries should be coming
from other directions too.

25:59.099 --> 26:02.018
The Demon Lord controlling them
is intelligent

26:02.102 --> 26:03.603
and capable of tactical action.

26:04.396 --> 26:06.815
We need to rendezvous with them fast
and discuss countermeasures...

26:10.860 --> 26:11.820
Where is he?

26:12.404 --> 26:13.905
Huh? That's strange.

26:13.989 --> 26:15.365
Seriously?

26:18.285 --> 26:19.202
LET'S SPLIT UP.

26:19.286 --> 26:20.287
YOU DO YOUR THING WHILE I GO STEAL

26:20.370 --> 26:21.413
EVERYTHING OF VALUE
FROM THE HOLY KNIGHTS.

26:21.496 --> 26:23.915
Where did that attendant go?

26:23.999 --> 26:25.083
How should I know?

26:25.166 --> 26:28.920
He's the first to prove
that we're untrustworthy trash.

26:29.004 --> 26:30.255
I'll end him the next time I see him.

26:30.338 --> 26:33.758
As expected,
I am the only one you can rely on.

26:33.842 --> 26:35.927
You need the power of miracles, right?

26:36.511 --> 26:37.971
I already told you.

26:38.054 --> 26:39.431
The power of a goddess is...

26:43.977 --> 26:44.853
Damn it!

26:45.353 --> 26:47.480
Can I make it in time
with the flight seal?

27:02.662 --> 27:03.747
Turn to ash!

27:07.375 --> 27:08.251
Take this!

27:33.276 --> 27:34.527
Draw your bows!

27:35.236 --> 27:36.613
Fire!

28:04.265 --> 28:05.266
What's going on...

28:05.767 --> 28:07.602
What's wrong? Hey!

28:08.686 --> 28:09.813
If it ends like this,

28:10.814 --> 28:12.649
it'd be way too easy!

28:13.483 --> 28:16.277
Take this...!

28:16.820 --> 28:17.946
Take this!

28:50.562 --> 28:51.730
Who are you?

28:51.813 --> 28:54.232
Are you Commander Kivia?

28:54.315 --> 28:56.192
My knight!

28:56.276 --> 28:58.653
Why did you abandon me?

28:58.737 --> 28:59.863
Goddess!

28:59.946 --> 29:01.114
Why are you here?

29:01.197 --> 29:03.158
Weren't you already sent to Galtuile?

29:03.241 --> 29:04.576
Don't worry about it.

29:04.659 --> 29:06.703
You! Did you do something
to the transport team?

29:06.786 --> 29:09.080
No, those guys are fine.

29:10.123 --> 29:12.500
Anyway, it's not my fault.

29:13.251 --> 29:14.586
Besides...

29:15.086 --> 29:16.838
We haven't forged a covenant.

29:18.339 --> 29:19.549
My knight.

29:19.632 --> 29:21.134
What does this mean?

29:21.217 --> 29:22.343
I told you.

29:22.427 --> 29:24.971
I hate goddesses.

29:27.140 --> 29:30.602
Go find your knight among these people.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.400
Explain yourself, quickly!

29:37.484 --> 29:39.986
Who are you, and what's going on?

29:40.528 --> 29:42.322
I want to do that too,

29:42.864 --> 29:45.283
but I don't think this is the time
for explanations.

29:48.453 --> 29:49.788
It's the Demon Lord...

30:12.101 --> 30:13.728
It's coming...

30:14.354 --> 30:15.897
Demon Blight

30:16.815 --> 30:18.233
Number Forty-Seven...

30:19.943 --> 30:21.402
Awd Goggie.

30:48.721 --> 30:49.597
It's here!

30:50.181 --> 30:52.058
Don't let it cross the river!

30:55.311 --> 30:56.646
Wait! Cease fire!

31:17.584 --> 31:19.043
- Get down!
- Take cover!

31:25.633 --> 31:26.676
Damn it!

31:26.759 --> 31:29.637
It can generate a force field
to deflect attacks?

31:29.721 --> 31:30.972
What a troublesome foe.

31:31.931 --> 31:34.392
We can only engage in close combat.

31:34.475 --> 31:36.728
Do you have a battering ram or a catapult?

31:36.811 --> 31:39.314
They're still being prepared
in the First Capital.

31:39.397 --> 31:42.025
While it's still on the other side,
let's try the scorched terrain seal.

31:42.108 --> 31:44.152
- Combat Engineer Unit, prepare quickly!
- Forget it.

31:44.235 --> 31:46.112
That would blow up the entire area,

31:46.195 --> 31:49.365
sacrificing the people carrying
the sacred seal and the land itself.

32:01.002 --> 32:02.879
We can't hold this front line.

32:02.962 --> 32:04.797
Retreat the troops to the east!

32:09.802 --> 32:11.137
Our plan remains unchanged.

32:11.220 --> 32:12.221
We'll hold the line at all costs.

32:12.722 --> 32:13.723
What--

32:14.265 --> 32:15.266
Are you kidding me?

32:15.350 --> 32:18.186
We were ordered to support your retreat!

32:19.354 --> 32:21.064
To support our retreat...?

32:22.398 --> 32:24.275
You're a hero?

32:24.359 --> 32:26.277
Yes, that's why I'm here.

32:27.570 --> 32:29.072
Galtuile Headquarters stated

32:29.155 --> 32:31.991
that the final judgment rests
with the commander on site!

32:32.575 --> 32:33.534
Then,

32:33.618 --> 32:35.703
we will sacrifice our lives for our honor.

32:35.787 --> 32:37.497
Who cares about your damn honor?

32:38.164 --> 32:39.666
Our honor is the most important thing!

32:41.000 --> 32:42.210
I've had enough.

32:43.127 --> 32:45.171
I don't care about your reasons.

32:45.254 --> 32:47.757
But what about us,
who are stuck here with you?

32:47.840 --> 32:50.510
I don't care what happens to heroes.

32:50.593 --> 32:53.388
You criminals
who aren't even allowed to die.

32:53.471 --> 32:56.808
And speaking of which,
why is the goddess here?

32:57.600 --> 32:58.851
I am...

32:58.935 --> 33:01.104
following my knight Xylo...

33:02.730 --> 33:05.525
We were ordered to transport
the goddess to Galtuile.

33:05.608 --> 33:09.862
We were going to complete that mission
and make this place our grave...

33:10.488 --> 33:11.489
But now...

33:13.116 --> 33:14.325
Wait a minute.

33:14.909 --> 33:15.743
You're Xylo?

33:22.250 --> 33:23.251
What's going on?

33:30.967 --> 33:33.177
No way...

33:43.813 --> 33:44.856
Get down!

33:51.738 --> 33:52.905
Report casualties!

33:55.074 --> 33:56.200
Xylo, look at that!

34:00.788 --> 34:02.331
What are these things?

34:03.624 --> 34:05.251
Don't... Don't come any closer!

34:08.296 --> 34:10.173
N-No!

34:12.216 --> 34:13.843
This is terrible.

34:30.943 --> 34:32.278
We must hold this position no matter what!

34:33.112 --> 34:34.739
Damn it! We're at our limit!

34:43.414 --> 34:44.916
Two more left...

34:47.418 --> 34:48.252
My knight!

35:07.605 --> 35:08.773
My luck has run out.

35:08.856 --> 35:10.316
You're still...

35:34.882 --> 35:36.217
My knight...

35:37.969 --> 35:40.680
Stand... up...

35:45.810 --> 35:49.897
Use... my power...

35:54.902 --> 35:56.195
At this rate...

35:56.863 --> 35:59.782
everyone will die a horrible death here...

36:03.035 --> 36:04.704
What kind of joke is this...

36:05.371 --> 36:10.168
I don't ever want that...
with a goddess again...

36:15.173 --> 36:16.257
Kivia!

36:16.340 --> 36:17.717
Use the goddess!

36:17.800 --> 36:19.719
You forge a covenant with her!

36:21.637 --> 36:22.805
Kivia!

36:22.889 --> 36:24.140
Where are you?

36:49.624 --> 36:50.625
Xylo.

36:54.462 --> 36:56.172
You are my knight.

36:56.756 --> 37:00.468
If this continues, more people will die.

37:02.845 --> 37:04.722
Are you going to let that happen?

37:07.058 --> 37:08.267
Shut up.

37:09.352 --> 37:10.186
I...

37:12.730 --> 37:13.731
Even if...

37:15.274 --> 37:17.193
Even if you hate me...

37:17.985 --> 37:20.154
Even if you hate goddesses...

37:21.948 --> 37:25.117
I will still grant you victory.

37:33.918 --> 37:35.127
Damn it...

37:37.213 --> 37:40.007
Please. There's no other way.

37:41.676 --> 37:43.135
I understand.

37:43.219 --> 37:46.013
Now, offer the price
for forging the covenant.

37:50.268 --> 37:52.603
- The way to forge a covenant is...
- I know.

37:56.983 --> 37:58.150
This will do, right?

37:59.860 --> 38:02.697
Teoritta, lend me your power.

38:03.322 --> 38:08.953
Then, do you vow to display
your greatness as my knight?

38:09.036 --> 38:11.205
I swear. Hurry up already!

38:11.289 --> 38:13.499
Very well, my knight, Xylo.

38:14.333 --> 38:16.794
I will lend you the power of the goddess.

38:25.177 --> 38:26.887
I still did it...

38:29.056 --> 38:32.310
This was how I threw my life away
all over again...

38:35.980 --> 38:38.024
Pact complete.

38:38.107 --> 38:40.484
I am now sharing consciousness
with my knight.

38:43.237 --> 38:45.823
What kind of blessing do you wish for?

38:49.410 --> 38:50.536
That's right.

38:50.619 --> 38:52.038
Show them what you've got.

38:52.997 --> 38:54.498
We'll send them flying back from here!

38:55.249 --> 38:56.959
"We will send them flying back."

38:57.043 --> 38:58.711
What a splendid resolve!

39:00.254 --> 39:03.090
Well then, I shall gladly bless you

39:03.174 --> 39:05.468
with the power of the goddess!

39:09.388 --> 39:11.015
Pray!

39:11.766 --> 39:14.727
I am the goddess of swords, Teoritta!

39:45.299 --> 39:47.426
How do you like that, my knight?

39:47.510 --> 39:50.012
I give you permission
to praise my grand power

39:50.096 --> 39:51.931
and worship me to your heart's content.

39:54.475 --> 39:57.853
Xylo, I said you have my permission
to praise and worship! Rub my head--

39:57.937 --> 39:59.146
Sorry.

39:59.939 --> 40:02.024
We still have things to do.

40:07.238 --> 40:09.490
First, we need to take care
of the remaining faeries.

40:18.707 --> 40:19.583
Give me the next sword.

40:19.667 --> 40:20.668
Good grief.

40:20.751 --> 40:23.254
You are to give me proper praise later.

40:23.337 --> 40:25.464
Only if we get out of here alive!

40:28.384 --> 40:29.260
Take this!

40:30.803 --> 40:31.762
Next!

40:33.764 --> 40:35.933
Next...!

40:36.016 --> 40:36.934
Next!

40:38.060 --> 40:39.812
This... This is...

40:41.063 --> 40:42.022
You're still alive.

40:43.524 --> 40:46.110
Kivia, you and the others
hunt down the remnants.

40:46.193 --> 40:47.361
Also, hurry and help the injured.

40:48.320 --> 40:51.198
Why are you giving orders?
A mere hero has no right to--

40:51.282 --> 40:53.576
To survive, of course!

40:56.579 --> 40:58.664
I don't intend to die here.

40:58.747 --> 41:01.500
And I don't want to see you all die again.

41:02.126 --> 41:03.294
So...

41:05.296 --> 41:07.047
I'm going to kill the Demon Lord.

41:08.257 --> 41:10.634
- What--
- If I come back alive,

41:11.427 --> 41:14.263
I'll gladly accept any complaints
or punishments.

41:14.346 --> 41:15.931
And I'm fine with any praise too.

41:17.183 --> 41:19.226
Xylo, we are going in, right?

41:19.310 --> 41:20.561
For honor's sake.

41:21.729 --> 41:25.608
Everyone just says
such boring, stupid things.

41:26.692 --> 41:28.319
For honor's sake?

41:29.403 --> 41:30.738
Are you out of your mind?

41:35.242 --> 41:36.660
Anyway,

41:37.495 --> 41:41.081
I just want to cut loose
in a full-on fight right now.

41:41.165 --> 41:43.000
Prepare yourself!

41:51.717 --> 41:53.010
Don't fall.

41:53.093 --> 41:54.428
How arrogant.

41:54.512 --> 41:58.098
It is I who should be worrying
about you humans.

42:04.647 --> 42:06.774
My knight, it is time
for me to fulfill my duty.

42:06.857 --> 42:09.109
No, not yet.

42:16.492 --> 42:20.329
Why? Are you underestimating me?

42:20.412 --> 42:22.957
I know that the power
of a goddess has limits.

42:23.040 --> 42:26.335
If you push yourself too hard,
that spark will grow stronger.

42:26.418 --> 42:28.003
That's...

42:28.587 --> 42:30.631
Don't even think about
fighting to your last breath.

42:30.714 --> 42:32.967
I don't approve of that.

42:34.051 --> 42:35.594
Besides...

42:35.678 --> 42:38.931
a goddess is supposed to leave
all the tactics to her knight, right?

42:45.104 --> 42:48.524
I'll clear a path!

42:56.156 --> 42:57.700
How marvelous.

42:57.783 --> 42:59.785
- It is my turn now...
- Not yet!

43:03.872 --> 43:04.873
Xylo!

43:08.711 --> 43:10.754
Teoritta, we're charging in!

43:18.095 --> 43:19.680
Xylo, allow me to take over now...

43:19.763 --> 43:20.973
Not yet!

43:27.521 --> 43:29.189
So this is the Demon Lord...

43:30.357 --> 43:32.568
I... I am not scared.

43:32.651 --> 43:35.070
It is a goddess's long-cherished wish
to defeat the Demon Lord.

43:35.154 --> 43:36.322
Now is the time for me
to fulfill my duty--

43:36.405 --> 43:37.656
Not yet!

43:38.282 --> 43:39.825
Just a little more...

44:00.763 --> 44:01.639
Take this!

44:14.193 --> 44:16.445
I only broke one,
and you're screaming like that?

44:23.661 --> 44:24.787
This is it.

44:28.666 --> 44:30.751
Xylo, we will be surrounded at this rate.

44:30.834 --> 44:32.586
It is about time I strike.

44:32.670 --> 44:35.297
Yeah, go clear a path!

44:35.381 --> 44:37.174
And make it a big one!

44:38.008 --> 44:38.926
Of course.

44:39.009 --> 44:40.761
Open your eyes and watch closely!

44:51.730 --> 44:53.524
- Next...
- No problem.

44:53.607 --> 44:55.818
I know what my knight wants.

44:55.901 --> 44:56.944
Can you do it?

44:59.238 --> 45:00.531
Of course.

45:01.115 --> 45:02.991
I am a goddess.

45:03.826 --> 45:06.370
All you have to do is pray!

45:16.296 --> 45:18.966
It's a big guy, just as I wanted.

45:25.431 --> 45:26.932
Die!

45:27.015 --> 45:29.393
You damn cockroach!

45:53.584 --> 45:55.419
My... My knight...

45:56.420 --> 45:57.296
All right, now...

46:02.551 --> 46:03.552
Teoritta!

46:07.556 --> 46:09.975
Xylo... Xylo!

46:10.476 --> 46:11.727
Xylo!

46:12.227 --> 46:13.437
Xylo!

46:17.024 --> 46:18.734
Xylo, how are your injuries?

46:18.817 --> 46:20.277
You protected me...

46:29.077 --> 46:30.913
My knight, can you hear me?

46:30.996 --> 46:32.664
Look at me!

46:32.748 --> 46:34.500
Ah... Xylo?

46:38.003 --> 46:40.422
What are you doing here?

46:46.428 --> 46:47.763
Scorched terrain seal...

46:52.351 --> 46:53.185
You...

46:55.979 --> 46:57.356
You went stealing again, didn't you?

46:57.439 --> 46:59.399
No, that's not it!

46:59.483 --> 47:03.487
I just snuck into the camp, and this
happened to be right in front of me...

47:03.570 --> 47:05.113
Well done.

47:05.197 --> 47:07.199
I'll spare your life.

47:12.120 --> 47:13.914
That... that is...

47:13.997 --> 47:17.751
The power is adjusted by the dial markings
and the shape of the grooves.

47:18.669 --> 47:21.213
I'm glad it's a model I'm familiar with.

47:21.797 --> 47:23.298
What should we do next?

47:23.382 --> 47:26.176
I'll give it another heavy blow.

47:29.346 --> 47:31.807
It's really over this time.

47:34.142 --> 47:35.644
- Xy--
- Grab onto me!

48:17.894 --> 48:18.854
What's going on?

48:19.896 --> 48:21.064
Is it over?

48:23.317 --> 48:25.569
The faeries are scattering.

48:25.652 --> 48:27.988
This is what happens
when the Demon Blight disappears.

48:28.655 --> 48:31.283
Though I've defeated
the Demon Lord a few times myself,

48:31.950 --> 48:35.245
this is the first time
I've seen such a stupid ending.

48:35.329 --> 48:39.458
However, it's also true that we won
thanks to this guy's sticky fingers.

48:39.541 --> 48:42.044
- I'll treat him to some good wine later...
- My knight!

48:44.630 --> 48:47.591
My knight, you brilliantly
defeated the Demon Lord!

48:47.674 --> 48:48.925
And it was all thanks to the goddess...

48:49.009 --> 48:52.512
all thanks to the magnificent grace
bestowed by me.

48:52.596 --> 48:55.682
I trust you have no objections.

48:58.268 --> 49:00.479
- No...
- Well then.

49:06.276 --> 49:10.155
Isn't it about time for you to praise me?

49:11.448 --> 49:12.616
Yeah.

49:13.700 --> 49:14.743
Good job surviving.

49:15.494 --> 49:17.746
That's a strange way to praise me.

49:17.829 --> 49:19.956
So just staying alive earns me praise?

49:21.458 --> 49:23.418
That's enough for me.

49:24.419 --> 49:25.337
I mean it.

49:27.339 --> 49:28.256
But...

49:29.466 --> 49:32.469
Is it really okay
for such a goddess to exist?

49:32.552 --> 49:36.181
What? How should I know?
Is that something others should decide?

49:38.225 --> 49:39.643
I see...

49:42.229 --> 49:43.105
Then,

49:43.188 --> 49:45.857
if what you say is true,

49:45.941 --> 49:49.736
then the fact that I survived
and defeated the Demon Lord

49:49.820 --> 49:52.614
makes me incredibly,
astonishingly great, right?

49:53.657 --> 49:54.616
Maybe.

49:55.659 --> 49:56.743
That is not enough.

49:56.827 --> 49:59.079
I give you permission to praise me more.

49:59.663 --> 50:00.622
Come on, now.

50:00.706 --> 50:02.499
There is no need to hesitate, right?

50:02.582 --> 50:04.668
Look, I am all ready.

50:04.751 --> 50:07.045
You can start whenever you are ready.

50:07.754 --> 50:10.424
Hurry up, hurry up! My knight!

50:10.507 --> 50:12.509
Fine, I get it.

50:22.769 --> 50:24.604
I finally found you.

50:25.564 --> 50:26.565
You are

50:26.648 --> 50:28.734
Xylo Forbartz, aren't you?

50:29.484 --> 50:32.195
And that's Dotta Luzulas
lying there, right?

50:34.030 --> 50:35.240
No matter.

50:35.323 --> 50:39.035
You stole the goddess in transit,
took the scorched terrain seal,

50:39.119 --> 50:41.413
and acted on your own
to subdue the Demon Lord.

50:41.496 --> 50:43.373
You truly are a serious criminal.

50:44.374 --> 50:46.334
Yes, that's right.

50:46.418 --> 50:47.919
Goddess Teoritta.

50:48.462 --> 50:51.798
You were supposed to be escorted
to Galtuile Fortress by us,

50:51.882 --> 50:54.801
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

50:55.385 --> 50:58.180
Although the transport team
had long departed...

51:02.058 --> 51:04.770
That hero stole you

51:04.853 --> 51:06.980
and forged a covenant with you
without permission.

51:07.522 --> 51:09.024
Xylo Forbartz.

51:09.107 --> 51:10.692
This is the scoundrel.

51:11.318 --> 51:12.903
I see...

51:12.986 --> 51:15.697
If that is the case,
then this must be fate.

51:17.616 --> 51:18.700
I...

51:20.535 --> 51:24.247
I believe in Xylo Forbartz.
I believe in my knight.

51:25.081 --> 51:28.752
He is the one
who will defeat all Demon Lords.

51:29.419 --> 51:32.380
He is the most suitable knight
to receive my grace.

51:34.883 --> 51:36.384
But, Goddess...

51:36.968 --> 51:41.473
You are unaware of the crime
this man has committed...

51:41.556 --> 51:42.808
Crime?

51:42.891 --> 51:44.643
What kind of crime is it?

51:45.143 --> 51:46.520
He killed a goddess.

51:47.813 --> 51:49.940
This man, who was once a Holy Knight,

51:50.816 --> 51:52.818
killed with his own hands

51:54.277 --> 51:56.238
the goddess with whom
he had forged a covenant!

52:19.678 --> 52:21.847
Defendant, Xylo Forbartz,

52:21.930 --> 52:25.100
Commander of the Federated Kingdom's
Fifth Order of the Holy Knights.

52:26.184 --> 52:29.062
Leading your own Holy Knights,

52:29.145 --> 52:33.984
on the eve of the incident,
you approached Demon Blight Number Eleven.

52:34.067 --> 52:36.027
Then, just before dawn,

52:36.111 --> 52:39.865
you entered into combat
together with Goddess Senerva.

52:39.948 --> 52:42.158
Is this report accurate?

52:44.035 --> 52:45.245
Yes.

52:45.328 --> 52:46.746
I knew it...

52:46.830 --> 52:47.831
It was him...

52:47.914 --> 52:52.377
I... fought against
the Demon Blight Number Eleven.

52:53.253 --> 52:54.838
It was a tough battle.

52:54.921 --> 52:58.508
Because the promised reinforcements
never arrived.

52:59.509 --> 53:01.595
The defendant is to answer
the questions only.

53:03.263 --> 53:05.098
As a result of the defendant
taking the goddess

53:05.181 --> 53:07.642
and fighting the Demon Lord
on his own accord,

53:07.726 --> 53:10.812
the unit suffered a devastating blow.

53:10.896 --> 53:12.355
Is this report accurate?

53:12.439 --> 53:13.565
It's not!

53:13.648 --> 53:15.150
It wasn't on my own accord.

53:15.233 --> 53:16.776
I received an official order.

53:17.360 --> 53:20.655
The Galtuile Fortress
never issued such an order.

53:20.739 --> 53:22.657
There is no such record.

53:22.741 --> 53:23.825
You're lying.

53:24.326 --> 53:27.203
The messenger on horseback
was carrying a legitimate order.

53:27.287 --> 53:29.164
According to the order,

53:29.247 --> 53:31.583
the Infantry Unit 7110
from the Uthob area...

53:31.666 --> 53:33.960
There is no such unit.

53:34.044 --> 53:36.880
You were the one
who was too eager for glory,

53:36.963 --> 53:39.716
forcing your subordinates and the goddess
into a reckless battle.

53:39.799 --> 53:41.176
No, I...

53:41.259 --> 53:45.221
Your unit has always been
prone to acting on its own.

53:45.305 --> 53:48.642
I heard you've committed
quite a number of related violations.

53:49.225 --> 53:50.602
It's a battlefield!

53:50.685 --> 53:52.854
Sometimes,
you have to make decisions on the spot.

53:52.938 --> 53:54.356
Besides, I have the authority to do so!

53:54.439 --> 53:56.232
That authority was granted to you

53:56.316 --> 53:58.276
by the royal family
of the Federated Kingdom.

53:58.360 --> 54:01.279
More importantly, in the end...

54:01.363 --> 54:04.574
you killed Goddess Senerva.

54:05.325 --> 54:07.243
That part is also correct, right?

54:10.622 --> 54:11.915
Yes.

54:12.791 --> 54:13.917
No way.

54:14.000 --> 54:15.627
Did he really do it?

54:15.710 --> 54:17.379
This guy is an animal!

54:17.462 --> 54:18.672
Goddess Killer!

54:18.755 --> 54:20.131
Sentence him to death now!

54:20.215 --> 54:22.342
Death is too easy for him!

54:24.135 --> 54:26.596
That's because there was no other way!

54:27.806 --> 54:30.934
We couldn't find the unit
we were supposed to rescue.

54:31.017 --> 54:34.062
The reinforcements
who were supposed to meet us never came.

54:34.145 --> 54:37.190
- We were completely isolated...
- There's no way they would come.

54:37.273 --> 54:39.985
In the first place,
there was no such order.

54:40.068 --> 54:41.653
Because you acted entirely on your own.

54:41.736 --> 54:43.071
No!

54:46.449 --> 54:47.826
Senerva...

54:47.909 --> 54:49.411
The goddess...

54:49.953 --> 54:52.622
She wanted to rescue that unit
and be greatly thanked by them.

54:53.164 --> 54:55.250
And because
she also wanted to be praised by us,

54:55.333 --> 54:57.794
she kept fighting
with her life on the line.

54:59.129 --> 55:00.505
That's why...

55:01.673 --> 55:04.092
she used up all her power...

55:06.636 --> 55:08.138
She was at her limit...

55:08.722 --> 55:09.681
That's why...

55:10.598 --> 55:11.725
I...

55:32.120 --> 55:35.457
Do you know what happens to goddesses
when they lose their power?

55:37.125 --> 55:39.461
They weaken and become defenseless.

55:40.128 --> 55:41.254
In the end...

55:41.921 --> 55:44.716
they get corrupted by the Demon Blight.

55:46.092 --> 55:49.262
There was no report of such a situation.

55:49.345 --> 55:52.766
That possibility was also denied
by the Temple.

55:52.849 --> 55:53.808
It was because

55:53.892 --> 55:56.853
the excessive amount of sacred seals
carved on your body went out of control

55:56.936 --> 55:58.688
that you ended up killing
your own goddess.

55:58.772 --> 55:59.939
What?!

56:00.023 --> 56:02.192
Cut it out with that nonsense!

56:02.275 --> 56:03.777
I'm perfectly normal!

56:04.569 --> 56:07.781
A goddess being corrupted? That's drivel.

56:07.864 --> 56:09.365
Just listen to me!

56:09.449 --> 56:11.034
There's nothing more dangerous

56:11.117 --> 56:13.828
than a goddess corrupted
by the Demon Blight!

56:14.454 --> 56:19.334
A Demon Lord capable of wielding
the goddess's power could even be born!

56:22.962 --> 56:25.799
Senerva knew that too...

56:27.050 --> 56:29.094
She was already beginning to be corrupted...

56:29.844 --> 56:31.304
So I had no choice but to...

56:31.387 --> 56:32.680
kill her...

56:35.475 --> 56:36.559
Inquisitor.

56:37.143 --> 56:41.272
The defendant has repeatedly uttered
blasphemies against the goddesses.

56:41.773 --> 56:44.400
Now that we've confirmed
the important points,

56:44.943 --> 56:47.570
I believe we should revoke
his right to speak.

56:47.654 --> 56:49.239
So it seems.

56:49.322 --> 56:51.991
Wait, listen to me!

56:52.075 --> 56:53.701
This is a serious matter!

56:54.285 --> 56:57.163
We can't trust the Temple or the military!

57:00.333 --> 57:02.293
If we don't hurry...

57:02.377 --> 57:04.587
and find those guys...

57:09.342 --> 57:10.552
I see...

57:12.262 --> 57:13.304
All of this...

57:14.222 --> 57:16.349
was a setup?

57:17.684 --> 57:19.894
Damn it... You people...

57:26.860 --> 57:28.611
I will find them...

57:29.821 --> 57:31.364
I swear it...

57:32.532 --> 57:34.701
I will find...

57:35.994 --> 57:39.914
the ones who set me...
and my Holy Knights up...

57:40.457 --> 57:42.041
And...

57:42.125 --> 57:45.211
I will find those who set Senerva up.

57:45.295 --> 57:46.838
Xylo Forbartz.

57:47.422 --> 57:48.882
- I hereby sentence you...
- I swear...

57:49.382 --> 57:51.468
- to be a hero.
- I'll kill them.
